{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 99,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.95471954345703,
        176.04971313476562,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Dosing of linezolid",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.584228515625,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "For adults, the prescribed dose of linezolid was 600 mg for the entire duration of therapy, without any",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.985039710998535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.4244995117188,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "planned dose reductions. These patients continued their treatment with BDLfx or BDLfxC. Clinicians",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.400146484375,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "assessed the response to treatment, and if they determined that the response was satisfactory, the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        364.9720458984375,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "patients were allowed to continue with their treatment regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        160.26649475097656,
        304.25653076171875,
        175.92648315429688
      ],
      "text": "Regimen duration, changes and extensions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.13453674316406,
        527.4398803710938,
        197.57752990722656
      ],
      "text": "Treatment may be extended to nine months if culture conversion is not sustained by week 16. In the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.3345489501953,
        527.43115234375,
        210.7775421142578
      ],
      "text": "BEAT-TB trial, the regimen was prolonged for three patients because of late culture conversion. All",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        209.53443908691406,
        527.2665405273438,
        223.97743225097656
      ],
      "text": "possible efforts should be made to support the patient and manage the AEs to ensure uninterrupted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.994348526000977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        222.7344512939453,
        527.5078125,
        237.1774444580078
      ],
      "text": "treatment and the intake of all medicines in the regimen; however, when medicine cannot be tolerated,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.957468032836914,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.9344024658203,
        170.9661102294922,
        250.3773956298828
      ],
      "text": "it should be stopped.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        257.6383056640625,
        527.4334106445312,
        272.0813293457031
      ],
      "text": "Linezolid is the leading cause of most AEs. If the clinician determines that the patient has responded",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        270.83831787109375,
        527.4193725585938,
        285.2813415527344
      ],
      "text": "well to treatment and that continuing therapy with linezolid would not be in the patient’s best interest,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980232238769531,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.038330078125,
        302.04217529296875,
        298.4813537597656
      ],
      "text": "permanent discontinuation of linezolid may occur.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        305.7423095703125,
        527.4124755859375,
        320.1853332519531
      ],
      "text": "Of the patients studied, 159 (78.7%) completed the entire 6-month course of BDLLfxC without",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.9422912597656,
        527.2793579101562,
        333.38531494140625
      ],
      "text": "interruptions. Eighteen patients had their linezolid treatment permanently discontinued owing to AEs:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980883598327637,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        332.1423034667969,
        527.4057006835938,
        346.5853271484375
      ],
      "text": "three patients experienced anemia, six developed optic neuritis and nine had peripheral neuropathy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.3423156738281,
        527.38037109375,
        359.78533935546875
      ],
      "text": "The time of linezolid discontinuation was earliest at 6 weeks and latest at 22 weeks. The BDLLfxC",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.54229736328125,
        527.4146118164062,
        372.9853210449219
      ],
      "text": "regimen has been studied as a standardized course of treatment. Therefore, modifying the regimen",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        371.7423095703125,
        527.4278564453125,
        386.1853332519531
      ],
      "text": "through early discontinuation or replacement of any component medicines, except linezolid-related",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        384.9422912597656,
        527.2888793945312,
        399.38531494140625
      ],
      "text": "adverse events, is not advised because it may result in different (and possibly worse) treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.1423034667969,
        118.55109405517578,
        412.5853271484375
      ],
      "text": "outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.9861145019531,
        380.46966552734375,
        444.6461181640625
      ],
      "text": "Missing doses and tolerances for treatment interruptions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.8540954589844,
        527.45751953125,
        466.297119140625
      ],
      "text": "Linezolid could be temporarily or permanently interrupted but the other medicines are to be used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        465.0541076660156,
        524.4017944335938,
        479.49713134765625
      ],
      "text": "throughout the treatment duration. Ideally, missing doses of drugs due to adverse events or non-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        478.2541198730469,
        527.403564453125,
        492.6971435546875
      ],
      "text": "adherence in the regimen should be avoided. If doses of all medicines are missed, any consecutive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        491.4541015625,
        527.4531860351562,
        505.8971252441406
      ],
      "text": "interruption of 7 days or more but less than one month should be made up for by extending the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        504.65411376953125,
        317.5763244628906,
        519.0971069335938
      ],
      "text": "treatment duration (for the number of missed doses).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        533.0853271484375,
        490.8592834472656,
        557.8803100585938
      ],
      "text": "2. Treatment of drug-resistant TB using 9-month",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.8853149414062,
        155.5281982421875,
        580.6802978515625
      ],
      "text": "regimens",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 19.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.2205200195312,
        471.1765441894531,
        613.1005249023438
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 2.1 The 9-month all-oral regimen for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        611.2205200195312,
        156.80848693847656,
        632.1005249023438
      ],
      "text": "MDR/RR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 16.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        643.805908203125,
        200.94850158691406,
        658.160888671875
      ],
      "text": "No. Recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        77.66929626464844,
        665.4205322265625,
        511.2431335449219,
        679.9735107421875
      ],
      "text": "2.1 WHO suggests the use of the 9-month all-oral regimen rather than longer (18-month)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        677.530517578125,
        510.5534973144531,
        691.9735107421875
      ],
      "text": "regimens in patients with MDR/RR-TB and in whom resistance to fluoroquinolones has",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        689.530517578125,
        182.56529235839844,
        703.9735107421875
      ],
      "text": "been excluded.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        112.86930084228516,
        704.5065307617188,
        389.42132568359375,
        720.1705322265625
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low certainty of evidence)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        330.23760986328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 2 Drug-resistant TB treatment: Recommendations  85",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
